// THE UNDERTAKER'S STOCK - ONE ROW, ON PURPOSE (2026-10-08).
//
// The reward list is the open question. This one row is here so the shop is not an empty window
// while it is decided, and because it is defensible on its own: the Scroll of imbuing is already a
// drop, so selling it for tokens is a second route to something that exists rather than a new power.
//
// HOW A PRICE IS SET, which decides what can go on these shelves. A shop charges the item's own
// cost scaled by param=shop_sell_multiplier (per mille), so the scroll's cost=100 makes it 100
// tokens - about four tasks at level 1, or one and a half deep in. There is ONE multiplier for
// the whole shop, so two items can only be priced relative to each other by their own costs: the
// muddy key was the other candidate and it carries the cache's default cost of 1, which would have
// put it on the shelf for a single token. An item whose gp value is not also a sensible token price
// needs its own obj config - which is what the custom rewards will have.
//
// THE SHELF SELLS STATUS, NOT POWER (Corey, 12 October 2026): nothing that changes a combat number,
// nothing that can be pointed at another player. The five outfit pieces carry no bonuses at all -
// not zeroes, nothing - and the cane takes your weapon hand, which is the strongest proof of it.
//
// The Scroll of imbuing is the one NAMED exception to that rule, kept at Corey's word. It passes a
// narrow test the rest of the catalogue does not: it is ALREADY A DROP (on-task kills, and far more
// often superiors), so this shelf is a second route to a thing that exists rather than a new source;
// it is untradeable and so is everything it makes, so no shop price becomes a market price; and it
// is slayer content bought with a slayer currency. Anything failing any one of those three is still
// out - which is why imbuing at the counter is not here, though it is the same effect.
//
// size is 8 rather than 1 so that adding a row is one line and not a resize.
//
// allstock=no MATTERS EVEN WITH ONE ROW: with allstock=yes a shop will buy ANY item, and this one
// pays in Death tokens - a player could turn a bronze dagger into currency.
//
// EVERY ROW IS EFFECTIVELY INFINITE, and it had to be fixed to become that (Corey, 12 October).
// The shelf held ONE of each with scope=shared, so the whole server shared a single hat and the
// next player to want one waited a minute for the restock. A shop whose stock is the limit is a
// race; the limit here is meant to be how many tokens you have earned, which is the only limit the
// design ever wanted.
//
// 1000 at a restock rate of 1 is the engine's way of saying unlimited - it tops a row back up by
// one every tick (World.ts), so a row cannot be emptied faster than it refills.
//
// stackall=yes IS PART OF THAT FIX, not a tidy-up. These are unstackable items, and a shop holding
// a thousand of an unstackable item needs ALWAYS_STACK or it wants a thousand slots in a shelf that
// has eight. slayershop has carried stackall=yes with fifty slayer gems for the same reason.
//
// restock=yes, one at a time: the shelf refills, so the shop is a tap and not a race.
//
// NINETEEN ROWS AS OF 26 OCTOBER: the eighteen below plus the ancient fabric, which remakes an
// imbued god cape in Old School's ancient colours and changes nothing else about it
// (areas/area_mage_arena/configs/ancient_cape.obj). In Old School the fabric is a reward from Pete
// Kayer's last challenge; there is no such challenge here, and this shelf is where this server
// puts a thing that is bought with Death tokens and sells status rather than power.
//
// SEVENTEEN ROWS AS OF 13 OCTOBER: the eight he already sold, plus one abyssal whip colour kit per
// row (areas/area_wilderness/configs/whip_colours.obj, generated). Nine of the seventeen are the
// whip kits, and they are the first thing on this shelf that is not his own outfit - the ninth,
// Gravedigger, is black with bone links and is the whip that matches the helmet.
[death_token_shop]
scope=shared
size=20
restock=yes
stackall=yes
allstock=no
stock1=slayer_imbue_scroll,1000,1
stock2=undertaker_hat,1000,1
stock3=undertaker_coat,1000,1
stock4=undertaker_trousers,1000,1
stock5=undertaker_boots,1000,1
stock6=undertaker_cane,1000,1
stock7=gravedigger_kit,1000,1
stock8=undertaker_cape,1000,1
stock9=whip_kit_volcanic,1000,1
stock10=whip_kit_frozen,1000,1
stock11=whip_kit_venom,1000,1
stock12=whip_kit_gilded,1000,1
stock13=whip_kit_shadow,1000,1
stock14=whip_kit_bloodbark,1000,1
stock15=whip_kit_tempest,1000,1
stock16=whip_kit_bone,1000,1
stock17=whip_kit_gravedigger,1000,1
stock18=royal_seed_pod,1000,1
stock19=ancient_fabric,1000,1
